2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3><p>The most-loved database by developers is also the most practical choice for agents. Postgres is flexible, powerful, and battle-tested. Neon is simply Postgres: with all the extensions, full SQL syntax, and everything your agent already understands.</p></div></li></ul>
